==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~16.67 seconds<sup>100f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichis]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~6.67 seconds<sup>90f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuu]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**5 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

